Output docs/assets/containers.gif

Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Width 1800
Set Height 1000
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20

Type "c9s --demo-data"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "/"
Sleep 500ms
Type "nginx"
Sleep 1s

Escape
Sleep 500ms

Down
Down
Sleep 500ms

Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
Sleep 500ms

Type ":"
Sleep 500ms
Type "images"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
